  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1314.07 Ramps",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1314.07 Ramps.\n\n(a) In the event a power lift system is not adequate to load or unload pupils with special needs, a ramp device may be installed.\n\n(b) Each ramp shall:\n\n(1) Be of sufficient strength and rigidity to support a special device, occupant, and any attendant;\n\n(2) Be equipped with a protective flange on each side to keep any special device on the ramp;\n\n(3) Have a floor made of non-skid construction; and\n\n(4) Be of such weight and design, and equipped with handle(s), to permit one person to put the ramp in place and return it to its storage place.\n\nSource. #8248, eff 1-4-05 (from Saf-C 1313.07); ss by #10439, eff 10-11-13 (see Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1300); ss by #14005, eff 6-22-24, EXPIRES: 6-22-34 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1300)",
